My Cover Studio V1

The application has no third-party runtime packages, analytics SDKs, AI models,
network services or bundled copyrighted music. It uses Apple system frameworks
(SwiftUI, UIKit, AVFoundation/AVFAudio, CoreMedia, PhotosUI, UniformTypeIdentifiers,
Foundation and CryptoKit). Apple frameworks are supplied by the user's operating
system and Xcode SDK under Apple's applicable terms.

CoverCore is an in-repository Swift package, not an external dependency.

Development tools only:
- Python 3 standard library is used for deterministic project configuration and
  optional simulator launch screenshots; it is not bundled in the iOS app.
- Pillow (HPND/PIL license) is used only to render the original geometric app icon.
  Pillow software is not bundled in the app; the generated icon contains no
  third-party image, font or artwork. https://github.com/python-pillow/Pillow/blob/main/LICENSE
- GitHub Actions actions/checkout and actions/upload-artifact are used in CI under
  their respective MIT licenses. No action code is bundled in the application.
  https://github.com/actions/checkout/blob/main/LICENSE
  https://github.com/actions/upload-artifact/blob/main/LICENSE

No AI separation, alignment or pitch correction model is included. A future
provider/model must have its license, device compatibility, privacy and cost
reviewed before integration. User-imported songs and media remain user content.
